      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "619．证明：当$n$是任何自然数时，分式$\\frac{10^n+2}{3}$的值是自然",
        "数．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "37．两个分式的商"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "为了得到两个分式的商的计算法则，我们可以应用分数",
        "除法的法则：分数除以分数，只要把被除数乘以除数的倒数．",
        "这就是说，当$a$，$b$，$c$，$d$取任意值，但$b\\ne0$，$c\\ne0$，$d\\ne0$时，",
        "等式",
        "$\\frac{a}{b}:\\frac{c}{d}=\\frac{a}{b}\\cdot\\frac{d}{c}$",
        "是真等式．",
        "我们举几个例子．",
        "例1．　$\\frac{5x^3}{6a}:\\frac{15x}{2a^2}=\\frac{5x^3}{6a}\\cdot\\frac{2a^2}{15x}=\\frac{5x^3\\cdot2a^2}{6a\\cdot15x}=\\frac{ax^2}{9}$．",
        "例2．　$\\frac{18a^5}{25b^3}:36a^4=\\frac{18a^5}{25b^3}:\\frac{36a^4}{1}=\\frac{18a^5}{25b^3}\\cdot\\frac{1}{36a^4}$",
        "$=\\frac{18a^5}{25b^3\\cdot36a^4}=\\frac{a}{50b^3}$．"
      ]
    },
